available: arch != "x86_32"
synopsis: "Compatibility rewriter for ppx_tested coverage annotations"
description: """
A ppx for coverage testing. Lets you mark expressions and code paths that must be
exercised by your inline tests; if a marked point is not hit by any test, a build-time
check fails.

Upstream OCaml does not support the underlying probe instrumentation this ppx uses, so in
practice it only type-checks relevant extension points and drops annotations.
"""
